# Tibalt, Cosmic Impostor (Valki's back face, cast for {5}{B}{R}) gets his emblem as he enters. +2 exiles the top card of each
# player's library, together: Bot1's Mountain and Bot2's Grizzly Bears. Bot2 then kills Tibalt with Vampire Hexmage, but the
# emblem names that Tibalt and keeps working (the card's rulings): on turn 3 Bot1 plays the exiled Mountain as a land and casts
